    52.1 ? dial=c1  "[p.44:] The program which follows permits the computer to \"learn\" which of three possible paths is the correct path to a goal, and to \"remember\" the correct path until instructed to \"forget\" it. [p.45:] The computer will find this correct path and will then always take that path until it is instructed to forget it. [p.45:] Turn power on. The computer will go directly to the start position. [p.44:] The start position will be the \"1\" setting on the rotary switch dial."
