 32323.7 ? dial=c1  "[p.44:] The program which follows permits the computer to \"learn\" which of three possible paths is the correct path to a goal, and to \"remember\" the correct path until instructed to \"forget\" it. [p.45:] The computer will find this correct path and will then always take that path until it is instructed to forget it. [p.45:] To set the computer to the \"exploring\" stage again, remove the connection from 6E to the path you selected and push the \"forget\" button—pushbutton 4."
