 38619.0 ? dial=c7  "[p.44:] The program which follows permits the computer to \"learn\" which of three possible paths is the correct path to a goal, and to \"remember\" the correct path until instructed to \"forget\" it. [p.45:] The computer will find this correct path and will then always take that path until it is instructed to forget it. [p.45:] Release pushbutton 6 and indicate a \"correct\" path by connecting the wire from 6E to D3, D5 or D7. Push pushbutton 6 again. The computer selects the \"Correct\" path and stops. [p.45 footnote:] * This programming wire may be connected to D3, D5 or D7 to indicate the goal. [p.44:] Path C: from 1 to 7 on the rotary switch dial"
